---
/* ===========================================================================
   /apply2 — VSL landing page, Danny Morel angle.

   URL is /apply2 (owner's choice); the pixel's content_name stays "danny_vsl"
   so Ads Manager reporting still says which client's page fired. Do not
   "align" them — see docs/meta-ads/README.md §4.

   Design is matched to the reference funnel supplied by the owner
   (gohconsulting.perspectivefunnel.com/apply) — same geometry, type scale and
   motion, recoloured to Synchro purple. See src/styles/vsl.css for the
   palette mapping and src/components/Vsl*.astro for the sections.

   Headline and subheadline are the owner's approved copy, verbatim from the
   brief doc. NOTE: the "over 100,000 qualified leads" figure comes from that
   doc and is not corroborated anywhere in this repo's data files — confirm
   before this goes to paid traffic.

   VSL: Wistia hashed_id 0penlfi67d ("Danny VSL — Apply Page (VSL 2_V4)",
   8:50, 1920x1080). Sourced from the owner's Frame.io share
   (F:\...\Kasper Ads\DANNY APPLY FUNNEL, 2026-08-31) and uploaded directly
   to Wistia — not the reference funnel's own file, so re-upload rather than
   reuse this ID if the video is ever swapped.
=========================================================================== */
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import VslFunnel from "../components/VslFunnel.astro";
import "../styles/vsl.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Apply — Install The Content Machine Behind Danny Morel | Synchro Social"
  description="Apply today and we'll install the same content machine that generated Danny over 3,500,000 followers, organically — without increasing your ad spend."
  bodyClass="vsl"
  metaEvent={{ name: "ViewContent", params: { content_name: "danny_vsl" } }}
>
  <VslFunnel
    pageKey="danny"
    headlineLead="Apply Today And We'll Install The Same Content Machine"
    headlineAccent="That Generated Danny Over 3,500,000 Followers, Organically."
    subheadline="Without increasing your ad spend or wasting more hours on content, we'll build you the same machine that generated him over 100,000 qualified leads."
    wistiaId="0penlfi67d"
  />
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  document.body.dataset.vslPage = "danny_vsl";
</script>
